      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "WMAP’s precise full-sky measurements turned cosmology into a precision science and strongly constrained the universe’s age, contents, and history.",
        "attribution": "Bennett and Page had central leadership and instrumental roles; Spergel’s theoretical work helped interpret the measurements. A large mission team makes individual credit consequential.",
        "maturity": "The measurements have been tested against later observations and remain foundational.",
        "uncertainties": [
