        "Eli Yablonovitch",
        "John D. Joannopoulos",
        "Sajeev John"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Photonic crystals brought band-structure concepts to light and enabled control of optical propagation with lasting influence across photonics.",
        "attribution": "Yablonovitch and John independently articulated key ideas; Joannopoulos helped develop the theory and its practical reach. Credit should reflect independent origins.",
        "maturity": "The core physics is established and has supported decades of experimental and technological work.",
        "uncertainties": [
